{"availability":"available","full":"AlexandrosPlessias/marketsage","name":"marketsage","description":"AI-powered stock monitor: live market data, LLM technical analysis, opportunity detection, paper trading (Alpaca), and push alerts via ntfy/Telegram. Runs free on Vercel + Fly.io with cloud LLMs (Groq/Gemini/Mistral), or offline with local Ollama. FastAPI + React. Not financial advice.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-20T16:01:30Z","updated":"2026-10-11T22:30:56Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://offgrid-trader.vercel.app","topics":["ai-trading-system","algorithimic-tranding","alpaca","alpaca-api","fastapi","fly-io","gemini","groq","llm","llm-agents","nfty","ollama","paper-trading-simulator","react","stock-analysis","stock-management","stock-market-analysis","stock-screener","technical-analysis","vercel"],"demo":"https://offgrid-trader.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:30:25.509Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:30:25.509Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:30:25.509Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:56.924Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T13:30:25.509Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AI-powered stock monitor with live market data, technical analysis, paper trading, and push alerts.","MarketSage fetches live market data, runs a cloud or local LLM for technical analysis, detects trading opportunities, and places paper bracket orders via Alpaca — all from a free-tier Vercel + Fly.io deployment or a local Docker stack. Runs entirely on free tiers: Groq / Gemini / Mistral for inference, yfinance + ta for indicators, ntfy for push alerts (no paid API required). Optionally run fully offline with local Ollama.","FastAPI + SQLite + Recharts. Discovers trending tickers automatically via Alpaca screener and yfinance — scored 0–100 by momentum, volume, trend alignment, and multi-timeframe RSI/MACD (no LLM quota consumed for discovery). Fully responsive — mobile ≤ 768 px shows a hamburger nav drawer. Code split into focused modules: 9 backend route files, 31 frontend components, 16 smoke-test domain files."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlexandrosPlessias/marketsage/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"74e159c9e5a53ee686e4d2ca7e702b122efe72de059ee082bff0aea07a3a7e1d","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.068Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.068Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AI-powered stock monitor with live market data, technical analysis, paper trading, and push alerts.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlexandrosPlessias/marketsage/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"74e159c9e5a53ee686e4d2ca7e702b122efe72de059ee082bff0aea07a3a7e1d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlexandrosPlessias/marketsage/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.069Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T22:30:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AlexandrosPlessias/marketsage/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:57.070Z","hash":"74e159c9e5a53ee686e4d2ca7e702b122efe72de059ee082bff0aea07a3a7e1d","originalBytes":21579,"storedBytes":21579,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:56.924Z","subjects":["Simulation & physics","MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Simulation & physics","MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Simulation & physics","source":"metadata","match":"simulator"},{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"llm agents"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Apple","Mobile","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://offgrid-trader.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"